---

This code builds on and fine-tunes VetBERTDx (havocy28/VetBERTDx on Hugging
Face; Hur et al., 2020), which is loaded at runtime from the Hugging Face
Hub and is not redistributed as part of this repository. No license is
currently stated for VetBERTDx itself -- check with its authors before
redistributing any model derived from it.
